<p>
  A <a href="https://tiptap.dev">Tiptap</a> editor bound with Tiptap's own
  <code>Collaboration</code> and <code>CollaborationCursor</code> extensions. The
  shared state is the <code>Y.XmlFragment</code> ProseMirror keeps its document
  in; carets and selections travel over awareness, which the server relays
  without storing.
</p>
<p>
  The editor is created after the first sync, not before. Tiptap seeds an empty
  paragraph into the document when it mounts, so binding early makes every client
  insert a competing top-level node.
</p>
